{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"て、さっきからずぅーーーと私の脳内に\n居座り続けてるこの言葉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでしたっけ???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのヤツかさっぱり思い出せない...；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もやもや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、無事に名古屋個握終了しました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いに来てくださった沢山の皆さま、\nありがとうございましたm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるカー以来の名古屋個握。\n今回もすっごく楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残すは、幕張全握、横浜個握ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストスパートはもぉーわーっと\nたくさんの方々とお会いしたいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてますからねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服写メ、忘れないように撮ったんですけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、自分の携帯じゃなくて\nゆみ姉の携帯で撮ったんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ、ゆみ姉からもらってないので...もらい次第Blogに載せますね★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見えないけど、こんな感じでしたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろにちゃっかり写ってる小さい姉さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隠れたつもりが、バッチリ顔写ってるっていうね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、何故か握手会で色々な方に\n「玲香は謎が多すぎ...；」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われる；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故か。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は友だちにもよく言われる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに、あまり自分の事は喋らない性格らしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも!!!\n別に隠してるわけじゃーないのよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問されれば普通に答えるさっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て、ことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問募集することにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気まぐれで、質問に答えていきます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな質問待ってまーす!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※たぶんお見立て会の時...懐かしいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/02/6258768/0009.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}